{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 500000, "duration": 37242719, "text": "The customer now supplies the context discovery cannot infer."}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 37742719, "duration": 56674758, "text": "Here the process is document intake and enrichment across invoices, contracts, and attachments."}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 94417478, "duration": 101820391, "text": "The intended capability is classification, field extraction, metadata enrichment, summarization, business-rule validation, and human review for exceptions."}
